# --- Detected directories (uncomment to exclude) ---

# docs/ is KEPT: architectural docs are part of the knowledge base
scripts/
e2e/
qa/
plans/
homepage/

# generated / vendored / lockfiles
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/package-lock.json
**/drizzle/meta/
# tool self-bundles — would duplicate every node in the graph
repomix-output.xml
# the plugin's own output artifacts — must never feed back into analysis
.ua/

